{"id":"617792","name":"白萝卜豆腐馅生煎包","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/617792/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"一个"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"一块"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"一根"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"少许"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白萝卜洗净，削皮，擦丝，焯水三分钟，捞出，挤出多余水分，剁碎备用。","img":"images/617792/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆腐切小丁备用。","img":"images/617792/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱切碎备用。","img":"images/617792/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"白萝卜、豆腐和葱放入盆中。","img":"images/617792/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加适量盐、少许五香粉、花生酱和鸡精，热油浇一下调味。","img":"images/617792/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/617792/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面粉中加少许酵母、白糖和温水，搅拌成絮状醒发两倍大揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/617792/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搓成长条状。","img":"images/617792/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/617792/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"擀成薄的包子皮。","img":"images/617792/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/617792/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"已包好。","img":"images/617792/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"平底锅烧热放少许油，摆好，如图所示。","img":"images/617792/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"平底锅倒入清水使包子的一半，如图所示。","img":"images/617792/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"用中小火煎至锅中无水底部金黄色即可。","img":"images/617792/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"出锅装盘。","img":"images/617792/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/617792/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"香味扑鼻。","img":"images/617792/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}